<title>NETHERLANDS: Internatio-Mueller details 1996 stock div.</title>
<headline>Internatio-Mueller details 1996 stock div.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and trading company Internatio-Mueller NV said on Tuesday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 40 held.</p>
<p>In March, the company said it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.40 guilders, up from 1.20 in the previous year. The payment could be taken up in cash or as an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Internatio-Mueller's shares closed at 57.40 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, down 0.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
